		{
			dependencies: ["308B363D1029D44E"]
			description: [
				"The abyss stretches for miles in every direction, yet faint signals flicker across your minimap, the signatures of derelict vessels once used to explore this world."
				""
				"Search the &3Abyssal Chasm&r using your &bminimap&r to locate one of these submarines. Some remain intact, sealed beneath pressure and time, waiting for a new pilot."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If you’re lucky, you may find one still holding power, a silent refuge amid the dark. Break it free from containment and use it to explore the Abyssal Chasm Further."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_ruins_submarine.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If instead you come across a broken vessel, it can still be restored. "
				""
				"Patch its corroded hull using &6Copper Ingots&r until the submarine seals once more. "
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_destroyed_submarine.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lUsage Notes&r"
				""
				"• Avoid using the submarine with a high &eField of View&r."
				"• The &bSearchlight&r does not function as intended when &ashaders&r are enabled."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
