		{
			dependencies: ["5994CCF6B8AB21FC"]
			description: [
				"At last, once you have laid claim to the rest of the &3Abyssal Chasm&r, earned the favor of the &8Deep Ones&r, and slain the &8Hullbreaker&r, you may finally challenge the &4Leviathan&r."
				""
				"Defeat the Leviathan to prove your mastery of the abyss and move one step closer to forging the &6Tier 6 Rocket&r."
