		{
			dependencies: ["709CA9D1D0CC59FD"]
			description: [
				"The great beasts of the &2Primordial Caves&r carry with them the weight of ages past. Their bodies are built from dense, ancient bone unlike anything found on other worlds."
				""
				"Defeat the dinosaurs that roam this land to obtain &fHeavy Bones&r. These durable remains can be refined and repurposed for advanced construction and research."
