		{
			dependencies: ["6D59C2329562EEAD"]
			description: [
				"The &eLuxtructosaurus&r is the apex predator of the &2Primordial Caves&r, a colossal creature born from molten stone and fury. Its roar shakes the caverns, and its scales glow with the heat of the world’s core."
				""
				"To summon it, drop an &4Ominous Catalyst&r into an active &cVolcano&r. The ground will tremble, and the creature will rise from the magma to challenge your strength."
				""
				"Defeating the &eLuxtructosaurus&r rewards you with &6Tectonic Shards&r, fragments of volcanic energy vital for crafting the &dTremorzilla Egg&r. Hold onto it for now, as the true potential of the Tremorzilla can only be unlocked by visiting the &aToxic Caves.&r"
			]
